{
  "id": "vyperCrmCaptador1",
  "name": "CRM • Captador com IA (texto solto → lead)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Captador de leads com IA\n\nMande **qualquer texto** (e-mail recebido, DM do Instagram, anotação, assinatura) para `POST /webhook/captar-texto` com `{ \"texto\": \"...\" }`.\n\nA IA encontra nome, telefone, e-mail, empresa e interesse, cria o lead e já qualifica.\n\n💡 Troque o gatilho por **Gmail Trigger**, **IMAP** ou **Instagram** para captar automaticamente.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "f5e0ea24-5e05-41d1-9974-b710564a4670",
      "name": "Nota d932",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "captar-texto",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a5cb06c-b88e-4355-ad58-35271f434f80",
      "name": "Receber texto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "6158ee04-483a-46cc-9f63-468ecc6d4547"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9100a5b6-a581-4a49-9f4f-e517990870d6",
              "name": "crmUrl",
              "value": "http://crm:3000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2b6cbf8-e42b-491b-b9d9-14d4da5c6126",
              "name": "crmApiKey",
              "value": "COLE-AQUI-A-CRM_API_KEY-DO-.env",
